      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KING HASS (2) has a terrific record this track and trip with three wins and three placings from six starts. Hit the frame latest (26.14) when third at this track in a Grade 4/5. With a clean break looks hard to beat. OWL HARDY (6) placed on debut then improved with a 4.5 lengths win (30.22) at Launceston over 515m. Harder here but expected to measure up. SELSDON (7) was a winner two back then strongly fancied last time but could only manage a second (26.23) at this track. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Expected to be in this for a long way.",
